\title{Common Quantitative Trial Decision Rule}
\description{
Internal ParameterSet base for frequentist and Bayesian quantitative decision
rules. Obtain instances of its concrete subclasses with \code{\link[=getDesignQuantitative]{getDesignQuantitative()}}.
